        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Frog That Leapt Too Far</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frog has unfortunately been abducted! Moreover, he has been thrown away like trash, without any explanation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confused, Frog will have to navigate home through unknown lands, occasionally meeting his distant relatives, who may either give him advice or simply vent out their concerns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers 35 levels of different complexity, forcing you to think in advance, when making decisions. Sometimes, the number of your moves is limited, sometimes not. It depends on the level, as well as which one of the two biomes you are currently in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features grid style movement system, where your goal is to reach the END cell of each level in a predetermined way, thus completing the puzzle. You may interact with other frogs, <i>futuristic looking doors</i> and springy things on your way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note (Spoiler): The nearby cell on every move is jumped over, while two consecutive cells are landed on. This, until you hit a wall and stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Frog That Leapt Too Far</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frog has unfortunately been abducted! Moreover, he has been thrown away like trash, without any explanation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confused, Frog will have to navigate home through unknown lands, occasionally meeting his distant relatives, who may either give him advice or simply vent out their concerns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Play</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers 35 levels of different complexity, forcing you to think in advance, when making decisions. Sometimes, the number of your moves is limited, sometimes not. It depends on the level, as well as which one of the two biomes you are currently in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features grid style movement system, where your goal is to reach the END cell of each level in a predetermined way, thus completing the puzzle. You may interact with other frogs, <i>futuristic looking doors</i> and springy things on your way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note (Spoiler): The nearby cell on every move is jumped over, while two consecutive cells are landed on. This, until you hit a wall and stop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "Frog was kidnapped by a crow, only to be trashed far away from home. He'll have to croak around to find his way back.",
